# Disney Lorcana Storefront Integration

Successfully integrated Disney Lorcana as a third major TCG category in the Coolex Shop.

## ✨ Key Features Implemented

### 1. Data & Infrastructure
- **Local JSON Sync**: Refactored the import tool to process the local [data/lorcana.json](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/data/lorcana.json) file. This handled over **1,000 cards** and all associated set data without requiring an internet connection.
- **Database Schema**: Implemented [lorcana_sets](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Lorcana_model.php#68-74) and [lorcana_cards](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php#120-127) tables within the existing [pokemon](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php#27-40) database for efficient multi-TCG management.

### 2. Storefront Experience
- **Dynamic Mega Menu**: The site navigation now features a premium "Disney Lorcana" dropdown that automatically lists the latest expansion sets.
- **3-Column Grid Layout**: Following user preferences, the Lorcana set listings use a balanced, modern 3-column grid with full-card clickability.
- **Rich Card Details**: Added Lorcana-specific statistics including **Cost, Inkable status, Strength, Willpower, and Lore points**, along with ability and flavor text.

### 3. Shopping & Checkout
- **Cart Integration**: Disney Lorcana cards are now fully compatible with the shopping cart. Users can add cards to their cart from the detail view, and the system correctly identifies them as Lorcana products.

### 4. Admin Inventory Control
- **Dedicated Management Panel**: Created a new Admin tool for Disney Lorcana. Administrators can select a set and instantly update prices and stock levels for every card via a fast AJAX interface.

## 🛠️ Components Updated

- **Controllers**: [Lorcana_Import.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Lorcana_Import.php), [Store.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php), [Admin.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php), [Cart.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Cart.php)
- **Models**: [Lorcana_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Lorcana_model.php)
- **Views**: [megamenu.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/templates/megamenu.php), [lorcana_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/lorcana_index.php), [view_lorcana_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_lorcana_set.php), [view_lorcana_card.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_lorcana_card.php), [lorcana_inventory.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/lorcana_inventory.php)

## 🚀 How to Verify
1. **Browse**: Go to the **Disney Lorcana** category in the top menu.
2. **Shop**: Select a set (e.g., "Into the Inklands"), click a card, and add it to your cart.
3. **Manage**: Navigate to **Admin Dashboard > Lorcana Inventory** to update your stock.
